        <p style="font-size:var(--text-sm); color:var(--text-secondary);">
          Working under Dr. Esteban Cisneros-Garibay on computational FSI simulation of bat flight.
          Extended and validated an existing FSI codebase, progressing from 2D flow models to full 3D
          flapping bat-wing simulations with membrane perforations.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:var(--space-2); margin-top:var(--space-3);">
          <span class="chip">Firedrake</span>
          <span class="chip">PETSc</span>
          <span class="chip">Python</span>
          <span class="chip">Gmsh</span>
          <span class="chip">Slurm/HPC</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prosthetics -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:var(--space-2);">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Co-Lead, Myoelectric Mechanical Team</h3>
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:var(--text-xs); color:var(--amber-500);">leadership</span>
        </div>
        <p class="meta">Accessible Prosthetics Initiative, UMD · Member Fall 2025, Co-Lead Fall 2026 – Present</p>
        <p style="font-size:var(--text-sm); color:var(--text-secondary);">
          Leading a ~6-person mechanical subteam developing a myoelectric prosthetic hand
          that starts at the wrist. Coordinating with the electrical co-lead on motor
          control and EMG signal integration.
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left:var(--space-5); color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:var(--text-sm); line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Designed preliminary housing and two-joint thumb mechanism in SolidWorks</li>
          <li>Leading mechanical design decisions for the hand assembly</li>
          <li>Coordinating design reviews across mechanical and electrical subteams</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size:var(--text-xs); color:var(--text-tertiary); font-style:italic; margin-top:var(--space-2);">
          Currently in the design phase — no working prototype yet.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:var(--space-2); margin-top:var(--space-3);">
          <span class="chip">SolidWorks</span>
          <span class="chip">Team Leadership</span>
          <span class="chip">Mechanical Design</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prosthetic visual placeholder -->
      <div class="reveal" data-reveal style="padding-left:var(--space-8); padding-bottom:var(--space-8); border-left:2px solid var(--border);">
